hadiths[55]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4985","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha gaya : sab sey behtar amal kon sa hai? aap ney farmaya : Allah aur uskey Rasool par iman lana."
"4986","Hazrat Abdullah bin Habshi Khas'ami (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha gaya : kon sa amal afzal hai? aap ney farmaya : aisa iman jis mein shak na ho, aisa jihad jis mein khayanat na ho aur hajj mabrur."
"4987","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen cheezen jis mein hon wo unki barkat sey iman ki mithaas aur maza paeyga : Allah Azza wa Jalla aur uskey Rasool usey siwa unkey sab sey ziyada mehboob hon, aur wo Allah key liye mohabbat karey aur Allah key liye dushmani rakhey, aur badi aag bhadkai jaey aur us mein girna usey is sey ziyada pasand ho ke wo Allah key sath shirk karey."
"4988","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen cheezen jis mein hon wo iman ki mithaas paeyga : jo shakhs kisi aadmi sey mohabbat karta hai aur sirf Allah Azza wa Jalla key liye mohabbat karta hai, aur jisey Allah Azza wa Jalla aur uskey Rasool siwa unkey sab sey ziyada mehboob hon, aur jo aag mein phenka jana is sey ziyada pasand karey ke wo kufr ki taraf laute baad iskey ke Allah ney usey us sey nijaat di."
"4989","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke teen cheezen jis mein pai jaeyn wo unki barkat sey Islam ki mithaas paeyga : jisey Allah aur uskey Rasool siwa unkey sab sey ziyada mehboob hon, aur jo shakhs kisi aadmi sey mohabbat karta hai aur sirf Allah key liye mohabbat karta hai, aur jo kufr ki taraf lautney ko aisa napasand karta hai jaisa aag mein daaley janey ko napasand karta hai."
"4990","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : eik din hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas hazir they ke eik aadmi hamein achcha nazar pada. uskey kapdey intehai safed they aur sar key baal intehai siyah. na to is par safar key aasaar they aur na hum mein sey koi usey janta tha yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas beth gaya. us ney apney ghutney unkey ghutnon sey mila diye aur apni hatheliyan unki raanon par rakh din. phir bola : aey Muhammad ! mujhey Islam key barey mein batao? aap ney farmaya : ke tum gawahi do ke Allah key siwa koi mabud nahin aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. aur namaz qayam karo, zakaat ada karo, Ramazan key rozey rakho aur Baitullah ka hajj karo agar uski taraf raasta pa sako. us ney kaha : tum ney sach kaha. hum us sey taajjub karney lagey ke wo us sey puchhta bhi hai aur tasdeeq bhi karta hai. phir us ney kaha : mujhey iman key barey mein batao? aap ney farmaya : ke tum Allah, uskey farishton, uski kitabon, uskey Rasoolon, aakhirat key din aur taqdeer, uski bhalai aur burai par iman lao. us ney kaha : tum ney sach kaha. us ney kaha : phir mujhey ehsaan key barey mein batao? aap ney farmaya : ke tum Allah ki ibadat karo goya tum usey dekh rahey ho. phir agar tum usey nahin dekhtey to wo tumhen dekhta hai. us ney kaha : phir mujhey qiyamat key barey mein batao? aap ney farmaya : jis sey puchha gaya hai wo puchhney waley sey ziyada nahin janta. us ney kaha : phir mujhey uski nishaniyon key barey mein batao? aap ney farmaya : ke londi apni malika ko janeygi. aur tum nangey paon, nangey badan, mohtaj, bakriyan charaney walon ko imaarton mein bulandi kartey dekhogey. Umar ney kaha : main teen din thehra. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : aey Umar ! kya tum jantey ho puchhney wala kon tha? mainey kaha : Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jantey hain. aap ney farmaya : wo Jibraeel Alaihissalam they, tumharey paas aaye taake tumhen tumharey Deen ka muamla sikhayen."
"4991","Hazrat Abu-Hurera aur Hazrat Abu-Zar Raziallahu anhuma ney farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apney sahaba mein is tarah tashrif farma hotey they ke koi ajnabi aadmi aata to wo nahin pehchan sakta tha ke aap kon sey hain yahan tak ke wo puchhta. phir ham ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey darkhwast ki ke hum aap key liye eik bethak bana den jisse ajnabi aakar aap ko pehchan ley. phir ham ney aap key liye mitti ki eik dukkaan (chabutra) bana di jis par aap bethetey they. aur hum bethey huye they aur hum bethey huye they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apni majlis mein they ke logon mein sab sey khubsurat chehrey aur sab sey umda khushbu wala eik aadmi aaya goya uskey kapdon ko mail ney chhua nahin tha, yahan tak ke us ney chatai key kinarey par salam kiya. us ney kaha : Assalamu Alaika aey Muhammad. unhoney salam ka jawab diya. us ney kaha : kya main qareeb aaun aey Muhammad? aap ney farmaya : qareeb aao. wo bar bar kehta raha : kya main qareeb aaun? aur wo us sey kehtey : qareeb aao, yahan tak ke us ney apna haath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key ghutnon par rakh diya. us ney kaha : aey Muhammad ! mujhey batao Islam kya hai? aap ney farmaya : Islam ye hai ke tum Allah ki ibadat karo aur uskey sath kisi ko shareek na karo. aur namaz qayam karo, zakaat ada karo, Baitullah ka hajj karo aur Ramazan key rozey rakho. us ney kaha : jab main ye karun to kya main musalman ho gaya? aap ney farmaya : ji han. us ney kaha : tum ney sach kaha. phir jab hum ney us aadmi ka qaul suna ke tum ney sach kaha to hum ney usey bura jana. us ney kaha : aey Muhammad ! mujhey batao iman kya hai? aap ney farmaya : Allah, uskey farishton, kitab, Nabiyon par iman aur taqdeer par iman. us ney kaha : phir jab main ye karun to kya main momin ho gaya? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ji han. us ney kaha : tum ney sach kaha. us ney kaha : aey Muhammad ! mujhey batao ehsaan kya hai? aap ney farmaya : ke tum Allah ki ibadat karo goya tum usey dekh rahey ho. phir agar tum usey nahin dekhtey to wo tumhen dekhta hai. us ney kaha : tum ney sach kaha. us ney kaha : aey Muhammad ! mujhey batao qiyamat kab hai? aap ney sar jhuka liya aur usey kuchh jawab na diya. phir us ney dohraya to usey kuchh jawab na diya. phir us ney dohraya to usey kuchh jawab na diya. aur sar uthaya aur farmaya : jis sey puchha gaya hai wo puchhney waley sey ziyada nahin janta. lekin uski nishaniyan hain jin sey wo pehchani jati hain : jab tum baghair samajh waley charwahon ko imaarton mein bulandi kartey dekho. aur nangey paon, nangey badan zamin key baadshahon ko dekho. aur aurat ko apna Rab (malik) jantey huye dekho. paanch (baten) jinhen Allah key siwa koi nahin janta : (innallaha indahu ilmus-saa'ah ... innallaha alimun khabir) (Surah Luqman : 34). phir us ney kaha : nahin, qism us zaat ki jis ney Muhammad ko haq key sath hidayat aur basharat dey kar bheja hai, main is sey tum mein sey kisi aadmi sey ziyada nahin janta tha. aur wo Jibraeel Alaihissalam hain jo Dihya Kalbi ki surat mein utrey."
"4992","Hazrat Saad bin Abi Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kuchh logon ko maal diya lekin un mein sey eik aadmi ko kuchh na diya. Saad ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney falan falan ko diya aur falan ko kuchh na diya jabkey wo momin hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ya musalman. yahan tak ke Saad ney teen baar (yehi kaha) phir Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main kuchh aadmiyon ko deta hun aur jinhen nahin deta wo mujhey un sey ziyada mehboob hain, is darr sey ke wo aag mein aundhey munh giraye jaengey."
"4993","Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maal taqseem farmaya, kuchh logon ko diya aur dusron ko na diya. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney falan ko diya aur falan ko na diya jabkey wo momin hai. aap ney farmaya : momin na kaho, musalman kaho. ibne-Shahab ney kaha : dehatiyon ney kaha : hum iman laye (Surah Hujurat : 14)."
"4994","Hazrat Bishr bin Saheem (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen tashreeq key dino mein ailaan karney ka hukm diya ke jannat mein momin key siwa koi dakhil nahin hoga. aur ye khaney-peeney key din hain."
"4995","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi (riwayat hui) hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : asal musalman wo hai jiski zaban aur haath sey log mehfooz rahen. aur momin wo hai jis sey log apney khoon aur amwaal key barey mein aman mein hon."
"4996","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : musalman wo hai jiski zaban aur haath sey musalman mehfooz rahen. aur muhajir wo hai jo us chiz ko chhod dey jisse Allah ney mana farmaya hai."
"4997","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs hamari tarah namaz padhey aur hamarey qibley ki taraf munh karey aur hamara zibeh kiya huwa janwar khaye, wo musalman hai."
"4998","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab banda Islam laye aur uska Islam achchha ho to Allah uskey liye har us neki ka ajr likhta hai jo us ney pehley ki thi. aur har wo burai jo us ney pehley ki thi, us sey mita di jati hai. phir uskey baad badla hai : neki das guna sey saat sau guna tak, aur burai usi jaisi magar ye ke Allah Azza wa Jalla us sey darguzar farmaye."
"4999","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke ham ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! kon sa Islam afzal hai? aap ney farmaya : jiski zaban aur haath sey musalman mehfooz rahen."
"5000","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha : Islam ki kon si khubi behtar hai? aap ney farmaya : (ghareebon ko) khana khilana aur salam kehna usey jisey tum jantey ho aur jisey tum nahin jantey."
"5001","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney un sey kaha : tum jihad key liye kyon nahin jatey? unhoney kaha : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : Islam paanch (sutunon) par qaim hai : is baat ki gawahi ke Allah key siwa koi mabud nahin, namaz qaim karna, zakaat dena, hajj aur Ramazan key rozey."
"5002","Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik majlis mein they. aap ney farmaya : mujh sey baiat karo ke Allah key sath kisi ko shareek nahin karogey, chori nahin karogey aur zina nahin karogey. aap ney un par aayat padhi. phir tum mein sey jo wafa karey uska ajr Allah par hai. aur jo in mein sey kisi (gunah) mein mubtala ho gaya aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ney us par parda daal diya to wo Allah key hawale hai. agar chahey usey azaab dey aur agar chahey usey bakhsh dey."
"5003","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon sey jang karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi den ke Allah key siwa koi mabud nahin aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. phir jab wo gawahi den ke Allah key siwa koi mabud nahin aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, aur hamarey qibley ki taraf munh karen, hamara zibeh kiya huwa khayen aur hamari namaz padhen to unkey khoon aur amwaal hum par haram ho gaey siwa uskey haq key jo us mein hai. unkey liye wo hai jo musalmanon key liye hai aur un par wo hai jo un par hai."
"5004","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke iman ki sattar sey ziyada shakhen hain. aur haya (sharm) iman ki eik shaakh hai."
"5005","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : iman ki sattar sey ziyada shakhen hain. un mein sey afzal la-ilaha-illAllah hai aur adnaa raastey sey takleef-deh chiz ka hatana hai. aur haya (sharm) iman ki eik shaakh hai."
"5006","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke haya (sharm) iman ki eik shaakh hai."
"5007","Hazrat Amr bin Shurahbil Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Ammaar iman sey unki haddiyon key godey tak bharey huye hain."
"5008","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jo tum mein sey koi munkar (buri baat) dekhey to usey apney haath sey badal dey. phir agar taqat na rakhta ho to apni zaban sey. phir agar taqat na rakhta ho to apney dil sey. aur ye iman ka kamzor-tareen darja hai."
"5009","Hazrat Tariq bin Shahaab sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jo tum mein sey munkar ko apney haath sey badal dey to wo bari ho gaya. aur jo apney haath sey badalney ki taqat na rakhta ho, phir usey apni zaban sey badal dey to wo bari ho gaya. aur jo apni zaban sey badalney ki taqat na rakhta ho, phir usey apney dil sey (bura janey to) wo bari ho gaya. aur ye (aakhir) aur ye iman ka sab sey kamzor darja hai."
"5010","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi apney dunya ke haq key liye itna sakht jhagda nahin karta jitna momin apney un bhaiyon key liye apney Rab sey jhagdengey jo aag mein dakhil kar diye gaey hon. wo kahengey : aey hamarey Rab ! hamarey bhai hamarey sath namaz padhtey they aur hamarey sath rozey rakhtey they wo kahengey : aey hamarey Rab ! hamarey bhai hamarey sath namaz padhtey they, hamarey sath rozey rakhtey they aur hamarey sath hajj kartey they, phir tuney unhen aag mein dakhil kar diya. aap ney farmaya : wo farmayega : jao aur jinhen tum un mein sey pehchantey ho nikal lao. unhoney kaha : wo unkey paas aayengey aur unhen unki suraton sey pehchanengey. un mein sey baaz ko aag ney unki aadhi pindliyon tak pakda hoga aur un mein sey baaz ko takhnon tak, phir wo unhen nikalengey aur kahengey : aey hamarey Rab ! hum ney jinhen tuney hukm diya tha nikal liya. unhoney kaha : wo farmayega : nikalao jiskey dil mein deenar key wazan key barabar iman ho. phir farmaya : jiskey dil mein aadhey deenar key wazan key barabar (iman ho), yahan tak ke farmayega : jiskey dil mein zarrey key wazan key barabar (iman ho). Abu-Saeed ney kaha : jo tasdeeq na karey wo ye aayat padh ley : (innallaha la yaghfiru an yushraka bihi wa yaghfiru ma duna zaalika liman yashaa ... azeema) (Surah Nisa : 48)."
"5011","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main soya hua tha ke mainey dekha ke log merey saamney pesh kiye ja rahey hain aur un par qameesen hain. un mein sey kuchh seeney tak pahunchti hain aur kuchh us sey nichey tak. aur merey saamney Umar (Raziallahu anhu) pesh kiye gaey jabkey wo (lambi) qamees pehney huye they unhoney kaha : phir tum ney uski kya taabeer ki aey Allah key Rasool? aap ney farmaya : Deen."
"5012","Hazrat Tariq bin Shahaab sey riwayat hai ke eik Yahudi shakhs Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aaya aur bola : aey Ameerul-Mominin ! tumhari kitab mein eik aayat hai jisey tum padhtey ho. agar hum Yahudiyon par utarti to hum us din ko eid bana letey. unhoney farmaya : kon si aayat? us ney kaha : (alyawma akmaltu lakum deenakum, wa atmamtu alaikum ne'mati, wa razeetu lakumul-Islama deena) (Surah Maaeyda : 3) Hazrat Umar ney farmaya : main us maqam aur us din ko janta hun jismein wo utri thi. wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) par Arafat mein Juma key din utri thi."
"5013","Hazrat Qatada sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Anas ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke main usey uskey betey aur uskey baap aur tamam logon sey ziyada mehboob ho jaun."
"5014","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke main usey uskey maal aur uskey ehl aur tamam logon sey ziyada mehboob ho jaun."
"5015","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! tum mein sey koi momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke main usey uskey betey aur uskey baap sey ziyada mehboob ho jaun."
"5016","Hazrat Qatada sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Anas ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya. aur Humaid bin Mas'da ney apni hadees mein kaha ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke wo apney bhai key liye wahi pasand karey jo apney liye pasand karta hai."
"5017","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai ! tum mein sey koi momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke wo apney bhai key liye bhalai mein sey wahi pasand karey jo apney liye pasand karta hai."
"5018","Hazrat Zirr sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ali ney farmaya : mujh sey ummi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ahad liya hai ke tum sey momin key siwa koi mohabbat nahin karega aur munafiq key siwa koi tum sey dushmani nahin rakhega."
"5019","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Ansaar sey mohabbat iman ki nishani hai aur Ansaar sey dushmani nifaaq ki nishani hai."
"5020","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke chaar khaslaten jis mein hon wo munafiq hoga. ya jis mein in chaar mein sey eik khaslat ho to us mein nifaaq ki eik khaslat hogi yahan tak ke wo usey chhod dey : jab baat karey jhoot boley, aur jab waada karey khilaf-warzi karey, aur jab ahad karey dagha dey, aur jab jhagda karey gaali-galoch karey."
"5021","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : munafiq ki nishaniyan teen hain : jab baat karey jhoot boley, aur jab waada karey khilaf-warzi karey, aur jab usey ameen banaya jaey to khayanat karey."
"5022","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey ahad liya hai ke mujh sey momin key siwa koi mohabbat nahin karega aur munafiq key siwa koi mujh sey dushmani nahin rakhega."
"5023","Hazrat Abdullah sey riwayat hai ke teen khaslaten jis mein hon wo munafiq hai : jab baat karey jhoot boley, aur jab usey ameen banaya jaey to khayanat karey, aur jab waada karey khilaf-warzi karey. phir jis mein in mein sey eik ho us mein nifaaq ki eik khaslat rahegi yahan tak ke wo usey chhod dey."
"5024","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs Ramazan mein iman aur sawab ki niyat sey (qiyam karey) uskey pichhley gunah bakhsh diye jaengey."
"5025","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs Ramazan mein iman aur sawab ki niyat sey (qiyam karey) uskey pichhley gunah bakhsh diye jaengey."
"5026","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs Ramazan mein iman aur sawab ki niyat sey (qiyam karey) uskey pichhley gunah bakhsh diye jaengey."
"5027","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs Ramazan mein iman aur sawab ki niyat sey (qiyam karey) uskey pichhley gunah bakhsh diye jaengey. aur jo shakhs shab-e-qadr mein iman aur sawab ki niyat sey (qiyam karey) uskey pichhley gunah bakhsh diye jaengey."
"5028","Hazrat Abu-Suhail apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney Hazrat Talha bin Ubedullah ko farmatey suna : eik aadmi Najad key ilaqey sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa. uskey sar key baal bikhrey huye they. uski aawaz ki goonj sunai deti thi magar samajh mein nahin aata tha ke wo kya kehta hai yahan tak ke qareeb aaya. phir wo Islam key barey mein puchhney laga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : din raat mein paanch namazen us ney kaha : kya mujh par iskey siwa kuchh hai? aap ney farmaya : nahin, siwa iskey ke tum nafl karo. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aur Ramazan key mahiney key rozey. us ney kaha : kya mujh par iskey siwa kuchh hai? aap ney farmaya : nahin, siwa iskey ke tum nafl karo. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey zakaat ka zikr kiya. us ney kaha : kya mujh par iskey siwa kuchh hai? aap ney farmaya : nahin, siwa iskey ke tum nafl karo. wo aadmi peeth pher kar gaya jabkey wo keh raha tha : main is par na izafa karunga aur na kami karunga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar wo sachcha raha to kamiyab hua."
"5029","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : Allah us shakhs ka zamin hai jo uski raah mein nikley aur usey sirf mujh par iman aur meri raah mein jihad hi nikaley ke main usey jannat mein dakhil karunga, khawah qatl key zariye, khawah wafat key zariye, ya usey uskey maskan ki taraf lautaunga jahan sey wo nikla tha, wo jo ajr ya ghanimat paey uskey sath."
"5030","Hazrat Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhu sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Azza wa Jalla us shakhs ka zamin hai jo uski raah mein nikley aur usey sirf meri raah mein jihad aur mujh par iman aur merey Rasoolon ki tasdeeq hi nikaley. phir wo zamin hai ke main usey jannat mein dakhil karunga ya usey uskey maskan ki taraf lautaunga jahan sey wo nikla tha, wo jo ajr ya ghanimat paey uskey sath."
"5031","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : qabila Abdul-Qais ka wafad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur arz kiya : hum Rabi'a key is qabiley sey hain. hum hurmat waley mahiney key ilawa aap tak nahin pahunch saktey. hamen kisi ahem chiz ka hukm dijiye jo hum aap sey seekhen aur apney peechhey walon ko uski dawat den. aap ney farmaya : main tumhen chaar chizon ka hukm deta hun aur chaar chizon sey rokta hun : Allah par iman. phir aap ney unkey liye uski tafseel bayan farmai : is baat ki gawahi ke Allah key siwa koi mabud nahin aur main Allah ka Rasool hun. aur namaz qaim karna, aur zakaat dena, aur jo maaley-ghanimat haasil karo us mein sey panchwan hissa mujhey dena. aur main tumhen khushk kaddu key bartan, harey matkey, taarkol waley matkey aur roghni matkey sey rokta hun."
"5032","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke jo shakhs kisi musalman key janazey key sath iman aur sawab ki niyat sey jaey aur uski namaz padhey, phir us waqt tak intezar karey jab tak usey qabr mein rakha jaey to uskey liye do qiraat hain jin mein sey eik Uhad (pahad) jaisa hai. aur jo uski namaz padhey phir wapis aa jaey to uskey liye eik qiraat hai."
"5033","Hazrat Salim apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) eik aadmi key paas sey guzrey jo apney bhai ko haya key barey mein naseehat kar raha tha. aap ney farmaya : usey chhod do kyonkey haya iman mein sey hai."
"5034","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak ye Deen aasan hai. aur jo shakhs Deen ko sakht banaeyga, Deen is par ghalib aa jaeyga. lihaza tum apney aamal durust rakho, darmiyana raasta ikhtiyar karo, khush raho. logon par aasani karo. aur subah-shaam aur raat key kuchh hissey sey madad lo."
"5035","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) unkey paas tashrif laye to unkey paas eik aurat thi. aap ney farmaya : ye kon hai? unhoney kaha : fulana hai jo soti nahin. unhoney uski namaz ka zikr kiya. aap ney farmaya : bas ! tum par utna amal lazim hai jitna tum taqat rakhtey ho. Allah ki qism ! Allah Azza wa Jalla (ajr denay sey) nahin uktata yahan tak ke tum (amal sey) ukta jao. aur aap ko wo Deen sab sey ziyada pasand tha jis par uska karney wala hamesha qayem rahey."
"5036","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wo waqt qareeb hai ke musalman ka behtareen maal bakriyan hon jinhen wo pahadon ki chotiyon aur barish ki jaghon mein ley kar phirey. wo apney Deen ko fitnon sey bacha kar bhageyga."
"5037","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : munafiq ki misaal us bakri ki hai jo do rewadon key darmiyan bechain phirti hai. kabhi is mein aati hai aur kabhi us mein. wo nahin janti ke kiskey peechhey jaey."
"5038","Hazrat Abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is momin ki misaal jo Quran padhta hai, turanj (meetha lemun) ki hai jiska maza bhi umda aur khushbu bhi umda. aur us momin ki misaal jo Quran nahin padhta, khajoor ki hai jiska maza umda magar khushbu nahin. aur us munafiq ki misaal jo Quran padhta hai, rayhaan (khushbudar booti) ki hai jiski khushbu umda magar maza kadwa. aur us munafiq ki misaal jo Quran nahin padhta, hanzal (indrayan) ki hai jiska maza kadwa aur khushbu nahin."
"5039","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke wo apney (musalman) bhai key liye wahi pasand karey jo apney liye pasand karta hai. Qazi (ibne-Kassar) ney farmaya : mainey Abdus-Samad Bukhari sey suna, wo farmatey they : Hafs bin Umar jo Abdur-Rehman bin Mehdi sey riwayat kartey hain, main unhen nahin janta siwa iskey ke Hafs bin Amr Rabbali key (naam sey) wao gir gaya ho Qazi (ibne-Kassar) ney farmaya : mainey Abdus-Samad Bukhari sey suna, wo farmatey they : Hafs bin Umar jo Abdur-Rehman bin Mehdi sey riwayat kartey hain, main unhen nahin janta siwa iskey ke Hafs bin Amr Rabbali key (naam sey) wao gir gaya ho jo Basriyon sey riwayat mein mashhoor hain aur wo siqa hain. unhoney is khabar mein Mansur bin Saad ki hadees mein baab sifaatul-muslim mein zikr kiya. mainey usey kehtey suna : main nahin janta ke Anas bin Malik ki marfoo hadees : (umirtu an uqaatilan-naas) izafa ke sath : (wastaqbalu qiblatana, wa akalu zabihatana, wa sallu salatana) Humaid Taweel sey siwa Abdullah bin Mubarak, Yahya bin Ayyub Basri key kisi ney riwayat ki ho. aur wo is hissa mein baab ma yuqatilun-naas mein hai."
